  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">本模组诞生于对将现实之美引入《我的世界》的渴望。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\">随着时间的推移，画作的数量会逐渐增加，但如果您有特别喜爱的作品，欢迎在评论区提出建议！<br><br>此外还在<span style=\"color:#0f0\"><a style=\"color:#0f0\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fatmospheric-paintings\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a><span style=\"color:#000\">上提供下载！</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">加入我的<strong><span style=\"color:#36f\"> <a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://discord.gg/REBxgemQCx\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></span>， </strong>以获取最新更新！</span><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><br></span></p>\n<p><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/368/669/paintings.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"714\" height=\"463\"><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">艺术家列表：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Banksy</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Zdzisław Beksiński</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Hieronim Bosch</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Salvador Dal&iacute;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Jan Matejko</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Claude Monet</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Edvard Munch</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Barnett Newman&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Mark Rothko</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Leonardo da Vinci&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">我推荐的其他优质模组：</span></p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#000\"><a style=\"color:#000\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/selectable-painting\" rel=\"nofollow\">可选画作<br></a></span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#000\"><a style=\"color:#000\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/classical-art\" rel=\"nofollow\">古典艺术</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#000\"><a style=\"color:#000\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pixel-paintings\" rel=\"nofollow\">像素画作</a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">该模组的材质包替代方案已发布&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#0cf\"><a style=\"color:#0cf\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/jess-painting-collection-texturepack\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jess 的画作合集</a></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
